speechtext:
First mortgage, I agree;
but $35,000 a mile. I ask my hon. friend to look at the bond issuing powers of the Canadian Northern and to look at the mortgage securing the perpetual debenture stock of the Canadian Northern in respect of its lines in the prairie provinces and I ask him after he has looked at these to come back and tell me which is the better security. I know which is the better security; there is no question about that, but as a matter ot fact it was intended that the different parts of the line should be linked up and that the line between Montreal and Port Arthur,
1,000	miles, should be joined up into a transcontinental .system between Quebec and Vancouver.
